@* A card's drawn marks: one layer per colour the frame's drawings use (css/themes/layers.css, .theme-marks). The card
   holding it is position: relative and isolation: isolate, so the marks sit over its surface and under its
   content. Decoration only, so screen readers skip it. *@
<span class="theme-marks" aria-hidden="true">
    <i class="theme-marks-grain"></i>
    <i class="theme-marks-border"></i>
    <i class="theme-marks-text"></i>
    <i class="theme-marks-accent-3"></i>
    <i class="theme-marks-accent-2"></i>
    <i class="theme-marks-accent"></i>
</span>
